│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ multistart_local_descent                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ Instead of applying relocation/swap descent only to the single best greedy construction,  │
│                          │ preserve the diversified greedy starts and locally optimize each of the strongest         │
│                          │ constructed schedules.                                                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Step-by-step:                                                                             │
│                          │ 1. Greedy construction is sensitive to its first transaction and tie ordering, so         │
│                          │ different starts can reach different conflict-ordering basins.                            │
│                          │ 2. The current code sorts these schedules but immediately discards every schedule except  │
│                          │ the first one.                                                                            │
│                          │ 3. A schedule that is slightly worse before local optimization can become substantially   │
│                          │ better after relocation moves because it may contain different transaction groups and     │
│                          │ conflict boundaries.                                                                      │
│                          │ 4. Run the existing exact relocation/swap variable-neighborhood descent independently     │
│                          │ over a bounded set of the best diversified constructions.                                 │
│                          │ 5. Retain the globally lowest exact simulator cost across all descents.                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This reuses the existing cost cache and exact makespan evaluator, while making the        │
│                          │ already-generated restart diversity effective rather than merely selecting the best       │
│                          │ unoptimized greedy schedule.                                                              │
