│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ exhaustive_local_descent                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the fixed six-pass improvement limit with descent to a true local optimum over    │
│                          │ the evaluated neighborhoods.                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Step-by-step:                                                                             │
│                          │ 1. The construction phase already produces several conflict-aware schedules using exact   │
│                          │ simulator makespans.                                                                      │
│                          │ 2. Each relocation, swap, and adjacent-pair relocation is evaluated with the              │
│                          │ authoritative `get_opt_seq_cost`, so accepting only strict improvements cannot worsen a   │
│                          │ schedule.                                                                                 │
│                          │ 3. A fixed pass cap can stop while an improving move still exists, especially when        │
│                          │ several independent conflict chains must be repaired one after another.                   │
│                          │ 4. Continue until none of the three neighborhoods offers an improvement. After a swap or  │
│                          │ pair move, relocation search is revisited, allowing the new ordering to expose further    │
│                          │ conflict-reducing moves.                                                                  │
│                          │ 5. Because every accepted move strictly lowers makespan and there are finitely many       │
│                          │ permutations, this terminates while producing a schedule no worse than the capped search  │
│                          │ and commonly better.                                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This preserves the existing targeted search operators and cache, but avoids returning     │
│                          │ prematurely before the local conflict structure is fully optimized.                       │
