│ patch_name               │ beam_vnd_ils                                                                              │
│ patch_description        │ This version combines three complementary conflict-aware search mechanisms:               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. **Exact beam construction:** rather than committing to one greedy prefix, it keeps     │
│                          │ multiple low-cost partial transaction orders. Every prefix is scored with                 │
│                          │ `workload.get_opt_seq_cost`, so branching decisions use the real simulator conflict model │
│                          │ rather than transaction length or write counts.                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. **Variable-neighborhood descent from multiple beam schedules:** the strongest complete │
│                          │ beam candidates are each refined using exact-cost relocation, swap, adjacent-pair         │
│                          │ relocation, and adjacent-triple relocation. Optimizing multiple seeds avoids losing good  │
│                          │ schedules simply because a different greedy prefix happened to have a slightly higher     │
│                          │ intermediate cost.                                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 3. **Iterated local search kicks:** once a schedule is locally optimal,                   │
│                          │ deterministic/randomized disruption moves create schedules in nearby but different        │
│                          │ basins. These are descended again with the same exact neighborhoods. This addresses cases │
│                          │ where several transactions must cross conflict boundaries together, which ordinary greedy │
│                          │ or one-step local search cannot reach.                                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ For very small workloads, exhaustive enumeration remains available and guarantees an      │
│                          │ optimal order.                                                                            │
